le><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"14\"></line><line x1=\"23\" y1=\"11\" x2=\"17\" y2=\"11\"></line></svg><svg aria-hidden class=\"svgicon icon_user_check on_unfollow\" role=\"img\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-width=\"2\" version=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><polyline points=\"17 11 19 13 23 9\"></polyline></svg><span class=\"on_follow\"><span class=\"full_label\">Follow SailingOcelot</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Follow</span></span><span class=\"on_unfollow\"><span class=\"full_label\">Following SailingOcelot</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Following</span></span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=add_to_collection&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fsailingocelot.itch.io%2Fwelcome-to-berylmoon-academy\" class=\"action_btn add_to_collection_btn\"><svg aria-hidden class=\"svgicon icon_collection_add2\" role=\"img\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-width=\"2\" version=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M 1,6 H 14\" /><path d=\"M 1,11 H 14\" /><path d=\"m 1,16 h 9\" /><path d=\"M 18,11 V 21\" /><path d=\"M 13,16 H 23\" /></svg><span class=\"full_label\">Add To Collection</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Collection</span></a></li><li class=\"community_link\"><a href=\"https://sailingocelot.itch.io/welcome-to-berylmoon-academy#comments\" class=\"action_btn\"><svg aria-hidden class=\"svgicon icon_comment\" role=\"img\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-width=\"2\" version=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\" /></svg>Comments</a></li><li class=\"jam_entry\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/jam/spooktober-2026/rate/5070102\" class=\"action_btn\"><svg aria-hidden class=\"svgicon icon_award\" role=\"img\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-width=\"2\" version=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"7\"></circle><polyline points=\"8.21 13.89 7 23 12 20 17 23 15.79 13.88\"></polyline></svg>Submission to Spooktober 8th Annual Visual Novel Jam</a></li><li><a href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/5070102/welcome-to-berylmoon-academy\" data-label=\"related_btn\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\"><svg aria-hidden class=\"svgicon icon_map\" role=\"img\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-width=\"2\" version=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_lato\"><div class=\"header align_center has_image\" id=\"header\"><img alt=\"Welcome to Berylmoon Academy\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMzUyODY3LnBuZw==/original/NgNjQS.png\"/><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">Welcome to Berylmoon Academy</h1></div><div class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top\" id=\"view_game_5925069\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game</p><div class=\"buy_row\"><div class=\"button_message\"><a href=\"https://sailingocelot.itch.io/welcome-to-berylmoon-academy/purchase\" class=\"button buy_btn\">Download Now</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><span class=\"sub\">Name your own price</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p class=\"text-center\"><del>Welcome to Horror&nbsp;</del></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">Welcome to Berylmoon Academy</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><br></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">You are a student.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">The world was entrapped&nbsp;in a terrible global war that has recently ended. Remnants of the past roam as physical manifestations. You attend an academy to study&nbsp;during the day and fight Horror at night.</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><br></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><em>Welcome to Berylmoon Academy&nbsp;</em>is a spooky themed visual novel with&nbsp;a linear story, a fully voiced cast and optional turn based combat. With careful choices the player can access friendship stories with their favourite characters and experience class at&nbsp;&nbsp;Berylmoon Academy.</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">Each day, the player can choose whether to study or socialise.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">During night, the player can choose to fight Horror through turn based combat, study or rest for another day.</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMzUzNjI0LnBuZw==/original/kBmqbj.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">The monsters in this game are called Horror. While the world attempts to recover from a brutal and devastating war, the remnants of the pain and anguish have become physical manifestations. Hunger.&nbsp;Fear. Regret.&nbsp;All have their own forms, lurking&nbsp;&nbsp;in the darkness and thriving in shadows.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">University-age&nbsp;students are taught to defend themselves from horror by using magic to defend these manifestations, while also attempting to remove the horror and trauma from themselves with mindfulness practice and social cohesion.\r\n</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">The peace of the academy is disrupted when suspicions arise.</p><p class=\"text-center\">Someone at the Academy is&nbsp;infected with Horror.</p><p class=\"text-center\">The player must save them.</p><p><br></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMzUzMTEyLnBuZw==/original/EWjSY6.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<h3>“Now, now, play nice. We are all better than this. I’m sure it was all a great, unfortunate, misunderstanding. Off you go, now.”</h3>\r\n<p>Vashanafarus is a vampire who plays the &#x27;parent figure&#x27; in the story. They wish to be supported themselves and accepted as a friendship group, though often they are the ones supporting others. They deeply wish to be a part of the world, feel connected, wanted and loved.\r\n</p><p>Voiced by:&nbsp;<strong>Sam Grace</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMzgwMzA0LnBuZw==/original/OW2ptX.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p><h3><em>“I suppose it is only natural, all the fears and darkness have to go somewhere.”</em></h3>\r\n<p>A fairy who is earthly, mystical and spiritual. Arcara was raised to join the war as a soldier, but the war ended before she was old enough to enlist.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Arcara wants a very separate, isolated life with animals and plants rather than people. Her childhood felt like the life of a cultivated bonsai tree, trimmed exactly to measure, her growth and interests completely controlled. Arcara seeks freedom and her own spirituality, allowing her to explore and understand the world on her own terms.\r\n</p><p>Voiced by:&nbsp;<strong>RedVelvetVA</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMzgwMzIzLnBuZw==/original/H7Gqwu.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p><h3>“Hey! It’s you again. How’s it going? Found the best place to sneak in a nap yet?”</h3>\r\n<p>Attie is a &#x27;super chill&#x27; human who appears to not let anything bother him. He is always taking time off class, finding places to nap and encouraging others to relax. While other students focus on fighting Horror or studying intensely, Attie reminds the player and other characters that it&#x27;s okay to take a rest once in while.\r\n</p><p>Voiced by:&nbsp;<strong>Kristoff Grey</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMzgwMzM4LnBuZw==/original/oVy8XQ.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p><h3>“Don’t beat yourself up about it. No one can outpace me on the field.”</h3>\r\n<p>Lucina is a sporty, outgoing merfolk who always wants to be the best. She can sometimes be seen as boastful with her enthusiasm.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>In the grand war, the Merfolk had a particularly rough time, some of their lands became uninhabitable, meaning they can&#x27;t return to them\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Lucina wishes to represent her people through sport and achievement. For her, winning means more than personal success. She wants to earn recognition for merfolk and to find pride in her community. She wants to protect an identity in danger of fading away as a result of the merfolk diaspora.\r\n</p><p>Voiced by:&nbsp;<strong>Melissa Carrington</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMzgwMzcxLnBuZw==/original/CFUJ2g.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p><h3>“Remember, the exam is next month. They’ll expect you to have at least mastered some of your magic by now.”</h3>\r\n<p>Steven is a human who strives to succeed academically. He is fully committed to his studies, and fears forming close relationships if it means it slows down his progress.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>While he can often be seen as an upright, cold and very blunt individual, his desire to succeed academically was his experience during the war. His community was one of the primary instigators, and it began when the society was struggling with extreme poverty, fascist propaganda and resource scarcity. Steven wishes to help rebuild his country to prevent resource scarcity and the other problems that generated the war in the first place.\r\n</p><p>Voiced by:&nbsp;Daniel McCarthy</p><p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMzgwMzU1LnBuZw==/original/3XZPrS.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p><h3>“It’s okay, I don’t want credit. In fact, it’d be better if they didn’t know it was me. Perhaps&hellip; you could say it was your idea?”</h3>\r\n<p>Haan is a werewolf who wants to become brave and make friends. He wants to be helpful, but at a difference. He is ashamed for who he is, what his people did during the war and has low self-esteem. He is high-masking, and struggles to accept and love himself.\r\n</p><p>Voiced by:&nbsp;<strong>Khai Truong</strong></p><p><br></p><p class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMzgwNDA4LnBuZw==/original/3x5P7Y.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p><h3 class=\"text-center\">Features</h3><p class=\"text-center\">A fully voiced cast</p><p class=\"text-center\">Original character design and art</p><p class=\"text-center\">Original backgrounds</p><p class=\"text-center\">Optional turn based combat and unique gameplay loop</p><p class=\"text-center\">Final boss</p><p class=\"text-center\">Intro cut scene video</p><p class=\"text-center\">Epilogue cut scene video</p><p><br></p><h3 class=\"text-center\">Dedication</h3><p>  This game is dedicated especially to any families and familial generations surviving conflict. Proceeds to any purchases of this game goes to <a href=\"https://msf.org.uk/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">Doctors Without Borders</a> to help real people overcome the Horrors of war and heal.\r\n</p><h3 class=\"text-center\">Credits</h3><p class=\"text-center\"> <b>Game Director<br></b>Sailing Ocelot</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><b>Game Designer<br></b>Sailing Ocelot</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><b>Lead Programmer<br></b>Sailing Ocelot</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><b>Programming Support<br></b>Nia</p><p class=\"text-center\"><strong>Technical Support<br></strong>Thank you <a href=\"https://feniksdev.itch.io/\" target=\"_blank\">Fenrik</a>&nbsp;for the rain affects!</p><p class=\"text-center\">